#!/usr/bin/env rexx
/*  Author:     Rony G. Flatscher
    Name:       1-071_demoDoOver_Enum.rxj
    Date:       2016-11-07 (refactored from 1070_demoDoOver.rxj)
    Purpose:    Demonstrate how to use DO...OVER and (starting with ooRexx 5) DO WITH...OVER with
                - java.lang.Enum class objects
                     - MAKEARRAY will supply all enum Java objects
                     - SUPPLIER will supply as index the ordinal value and as item the enum Java object
    Needs:      - BSF4ooRexx
                - ooRexx 5.0 or later
    Changed:    2016-12-21, rgf: make sure that "DO WITH" gets run on ooRexx 5.0 or higher
                2018-10-07, rgf: use new entry .bsf4rexx~rexx.version
                2022-01-20, rgf: - removed checks for ooRexx 5.0 or later as previous versions of ooRexx
                                   would cause a syntax error already
                                 - refactored the routines to proper Rexx programs to ease spotting
                                   DoOver samples that may be of interest to the programmer
    License:
    ------------------------ Apache Version 2.0 license -------------------------
       Copyright (C) 2022 Rony G. Flatscher

       Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
       you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.
       You may obtain a copy of the License at

           http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

       Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software
       distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS,
       WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
       See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
       limitations under the License.
    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/

tab="    "                 -- define indentation
line="-"~copies(79)        -- define line

-- demonstrates iterating over a java.lang.Enum class'es defined enum values
say "Demo DO..OVER a java.lang.Enum class object's enum values"
say
javaClz="org.oorexx.misc.OldGreekAlphabetEnum"  -- a demo Enum class
say tab "loading the Java enum class" pp(javaClz) "..."
clz=bsf.loadClass(javaClz)
say

say tab "a) iterating over all enum values after explicitly sending MAKEARRAY to the Java Enum class:"
say
do e over clz~makearray
   say tab tab "ordinal:" pp(e~ordinal~right(2)) "name:" pp(e~name)
end
say

say tab "b) iterating over all enum values using DO...OVER (sends MAKEARRAY message implicitly):"
say
do e over clz  -- "do e over clz" will cause ooRexx to send the MAKEARRAY message to "clz"
      -- on enum value: instead of "name" one could use "toString" as well to get at its string representation
   say tab tab "ordinal:" pp(e~ordinal~right(2)) "name:" pp(e~name)
end
say

say tab "c) iterating over all enum values using DO WITH...OVER (sends SUPPLIER message implicitly):"
say
do with index o item e over clz
   say tab tab "index (ordinal):" pp(o~right(2)) "item (name):" pp(e~name)
end

say line

::requires "BSF.CLS" -- get Java support
